{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical chaos of <i>Machick 2</i> with its official Original Soundtrack.<br>This collection brings together every track that fuels the energy, absurdity, and fast-paced action of the game \u2014 from the lighthearted tunes of the early runs to the intense, chaotic beats that drive the battles against hordes of monster toads and colossal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composed to match the game\u2019s unique blend of humor and madness, the <i>Machick 2 OST</i> captures both the silly charm and the epic scale of your adventure. Whether you\u2019re crafting absurd wands, unlocking relics, or surviving the infinite mode, each track was designed to keep the chaos alive even outside the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your favorite runs, enjoy the magical melodies, and let the soundtrack remind you why <i>Machick 2</i> is chaotic, funny, and addictive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029490?t=1766487672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029490?t=1766487672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029490/d06c4f0a7cad88be84aff1ba6373067fce1ef2c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766487672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029490/d06c4f0a7cad88be84aff1ba6373067fce1ef2c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766487672","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical chaos of <i>Machick 2</i> with its official Original Soundtrack.<br>This collection brings together every track that fuels the energy, absurdity, and fast-paced action of the game \u2014 from the lighthearted tunes of the early runs to the intense, chaotic beats that drive the battles against hordes of monster toads and 